
<& /page/page_title.mas, title => $m->interp->apply_escapes( __("Dataset Help"), 'h' ) &>

<p><b><% __('Working with Datasets') |h %></b></p>

<p><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Datasets are collections of identifiers that are stored in the database.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Datasets can be composed of accessions, plots, traits, locations, and trials.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Datasets are attached to the individual user’s account, and can only be created and seen by the user while logged in.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('SGN databases use Datasets in analysis tools on the website such as Wizard, GWAS, GS, Heritability, and Stability tools.') &></p>

<p><b><% __('Creating Datasets') |h %></b></p>

<p><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Datasets are generated in the Wizard.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Up to 4 identifiers can be selected.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('First select the categories and entries in each column.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('In this example we have selected Trials, Accessions, and Genotyping Protocols.') &>
<& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Then enter a name in the “Create New Dataset” section.') &> In this example we have
used “Tinker QTL 2021”. <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('After creating the dataset, you can make it public for others to use by first selecting the dataset using the “Load Dataset” list then selecting the “Make Public” button.') &></p>
<img src="/static/documents/help/screenshots/DatasetHelpImage001.png" width="1000px">
<img src="/static/documents/help/screenshots/DatasetHelpImage002.png" width="600px">

<p><b><% __('Retrieving Datasets') |h %></b></p>

<p><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('To retrieve a dataset in the Wizard, select the dataset in the “Load Dataset” input then select the “Load” button.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('This will populate the columns in the Wizard and then allow you to download and analyze the dataset.') &></p><br>
<img src="/static/documents/help/screenshots/DatasetHelpImage003.png" width="600px">

<p><b><% __('Searching Datasets') |h %></b></p>

<p><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('To search for a dataset, select the “Datasets” link in the toolbar at the top right of the website.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Selecting the Dataset name will give you a Dataset Detail page') &></p><br>
<img src="/static/documents/help/screenshots/DatasetHelpImage004.png" width="800px">
<img src="/static/documents/help/screenshots/DatasetHelpImage005.png" width="800px">

<br><br>
<p><& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Datasets can also be used in publications for linking available data.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Copy the URL from the detail page found in the Search Datasets page.') &></p>

